   "body": "**Adversarial review round 2 (Opus 5.5) — APPROVE** — head 3b3e4cc3 (round 1: APPROVE with minors at 4ddfd1f1)\n\nFindings: none. Round-1 items 1, 4 and 5 are fixed; item 2 (Mac check of the \"…\" order on iPhone and iPad) and item 3 (shipping apart from #820/#821) are process items, recorded in the PR body.\n\n- `ReaderOfflineSave.swift:36-56`: `ReaderOfflineMenuItems` returns the same buttons on the same conditions; a View struct inside `.secondaryAction` renders as menu items, as `ReaderPageMenuItems` already does.\n- `saver.isSaving` is read only in `ReaderOfflineMenuItems.body`; `TopicReaderView` reads only whether `saver` is nil (`isOffered`), so a saved page no longer re-runs the reader body.\n- State ownership unchanged (`saver` and `search` are `@State` in `TopicReaderView`; the banner stays in the modifier); no caller of the removed `ReaderOfflineSave.menu` left.\n- Citations: the legacy `Menu {` at about :5576, then Rechercher, Répondre, the `Divider`, `pageChoiceMenuItems` to :5604; `:4718-4720` now `@ 2440d79`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
